From: ThinkSmart local build <thinksmart@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: apq8053-lenovo: disable unused IPA

The ThinkSmart View has no cellular modem. Its board description
already removes modem-related reserved memory, but inherits an enabled
IPA node and its interconnect supplier links from msm8953.dtsi.

Disable this unused modem packet accelerator on the board. Otherwise,
without the IPA-lite driver, it prevents the interconnect providers
from completing sync_state and releasing their initial bandwidth
floors. Wi-Fi uses a separate SDIO interface and does not need IPA.
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/apq8053-lenovo-cd-18781y.dts | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

Origin: Local ThinkSmart View port
Base-commit: 7213855948c70fd165356526f1de1c3b6bf4d554
Apply in filename order within this project.

---
diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/apq8053-lenovo-cd-18781y.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/apq8053-lenovo-cd-18781y.dts
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/apq8053-lenovo-cd-18781y.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/apq8053-lenovo-cd-18781y.dts
@@ -735,3 +735,7 @@
+&ipa {
+	status = "disabled";
+};
+
 &usb3 {
 	status = "okay";
 };
